"use": "立体駐車場 (自走式, self-park): a 26 x 50 m car park, ground + three decks (the top one open to the sky), 3.3 m storeys (3.0 m clear: a 2 t truck fits) -- up ramps on the west, down ramps on the east (4.5 m wide, 36 m: 5 m half-grade transitions at each end, 10.6 % between; user 2026-10-05), 2.5 x 5.0 m bays either side of a 7 m aisle, 7 m cross aisles, wheel stops, parapets, a gate booth with its arm raised at the south entrance, a stair tower on the south-east corner and a lift. Parked cars on MARK_vehicle. probe_xz is the aisle. kits/interiors/ParkingGarage.blend (a PLACEHOLDER shell and fit-out, ARTIST_NOTES.md lists what to replace)",
